    "Introduction: The first $300 is a starting point, not a strategy\nBuilding meaningful income rarely begins with one perfect idea. It can begin with small opportunities: buying something below its resale value, offering a simple service, learning to sell, saving wages, testing an online store, or publishing useful information.",
    "The journey in this playbook follows a progression from small offline side hustles to e-commerce, content creation, affiliate income, and a digital course. The central lesson is not that every reader should copy every business model. It is that each stage can create capital, practical experience, and knowledge that make the next stage possible.",
