        "These figures describe reported sales or revenue, not necessarily net profit.\nWhy diversify acquisition channels?\nA business that depends on one influencer page or one platform can become fragile.",
        "A more deliberate acquisition system may combine:\n- Paid social advertising.\n- Influencer placements.\n- Organic content.\n- Email marketing.\n- Repeat-customer campaigns.\n- Search traffic.\n- Partnerships.\nEach channel has different costs, time requirements, and measurement challenges.\nLearn paid advertising before scaling spend\nA basic paid-social test should have:\n- A clearly defined target customer.\n- One product and one primary offer.\n- A product page that explains the value.\n- Creative that demonstrates the product.\n- A controlled budget.\n- Conversion tracking.\n- A stop-loss rule.\n- A fulfilment plan.\nDo not increase budgets just because a few orders arrive. Wait until you have enough data to assess the economics and ensure that orders can be delivered.\nUnderstand the role of seasonality\nThe source describes stronger performance around the Q4 shopping period, including Black Friday and Cyber Monday.",
