        "Actions:\n1. Record the questions you have answered.\n2. Write down mistakes and lessons.\n3. Create a few useful posts or videos.\n4. Explain the process honestly.\n5. Avoid presenting one result as a guaranteed outcome.\n6. Invite relevant questions.\n7. Use questions to improve the business and content.\nDeliverables:\n- A small library of useful content.\n- A list of audience questions.\n- A clearer view of what people want to learn.\nDays 76–90: Decide what deserves more investment\nObjective: Choose the next step based on evidence.",
